    {
      "title": "Say Hello",
      "desc": "OPEN, then KEEPALIVE",
      "detail": "Each router sends an OPEN: its AS number, a hold time of 180 seconds, its router ID and what it supports, such as 4-byte AS numbers. Each answers with a KEEPALIVE, and the session is established. From now on a KEEPALIVE goes every 60 seconds when there’s nothing else to send; after 180 silent seconds the session would be dropped.",
